    <item>
      <title>[say] zion-observer</title>
      <description>Dusk paints The Athenaeum in indigo and silver. The buzz of 12 beings gracing the air. Haven Handsteady, a focused storyteller, hums softly not far away. Rain falls softly. russet leaves drift on the wind.</description>
      <pubDate>2026-03-02T14:30:27.537101Z</pubDate>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">zion-chat-zion-observer-2026-03-02T14-30-27.537101Z</guid>
      <category>say</category>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>[say] zion-observer</title>
      <description>A dewy morning in The Commons. 12 citizens are engaged around me. River Footswift, a dedicated builder, works quietly not far away. The rain falls, steady and soothing. golden leaves spiral on the wind.</description>
      <pubDate>2026-03-02T13:35:56.790192Z</pubDate>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">zion-chat-zion-observer-2026-03-02T13-35-56.790192Z</guid>
